# Injected into buem-service, buem-app, and buem-reverse-proxy via env_file. Dev-only defaults — replace both values below before any real deployment; this file is intentionally tracked (like ignis's docker.env) so a fresh clone runs out of the box, the same way ignis's does.

# CORS — origins allowed to call this API from a browser. Comma-separated, no trailing slash. buem-reverse-proxy derives a regex from this at startup for its preflight matcher (see docker-compose.yml + Caddyfile).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:8000,https://enerplanet.github.io
